Subject: [PATCH] Lithium: optimize non-POI block searches

Changes made during porting:
1. Replaced getChunk with Paper's getChunkIfLoadedImmediately
2. Update Paper movingTarget when search succeeds

This patch is based on the following Lithium mixins:
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/ai/non_poi_block_search/HoglinSpecificSensorMixin.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/ai/non_poi_block_search/MoveToBlockGoalMixin.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/ai/non_poi_block_search/PiglinSpecificSensorMixin.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/ai/non_poi_block_search/RemoveBlockGoalMixin.java"

It also ports the following supporting sources:
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/common/ai/non_poi_block_search/CheckAndCacheBlockChecker.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/common/ai/non_poi_block_search/CommonBlockSearchesCheckAndCache.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/common/ai/non_poi_block_search/LithiumMoveToBlockGoal.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/common/ai/non_poi_block_search/NonPOISearchDistances.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/common/util/Distances.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/common/util/collections/FixedChunkAccessSectionBitBuffer.java"
By: jcw780 <30562395+jcw780@users.noreply.github.com>, 2No2Name <2No2Name@web.de>
